# Vendored legacy compatibility artifacts are compared byte for byte, not
# read as ordinary source: `check_legacy_lang_drift.py` and
# `check_legacy_spreadsheet_columns_drift.py` diff the exact text they
# exported from PHP, and `LegacyEmployeeTemplateTest` asserts that the CSV
# this application generates equals the one PHP generates, byte for byte.
#
# On a checkout with `core.autocrlf=true` -- the Git for Windows default --
# line-ending conversion would rewrite these files after export and turn
# every one of those comparisons into a false failure. `-text` keeps them
# exactly as committed on every platform.
backend/src/main/resources/legacy/** -text
backend/src/test/resources/legacy/** -text

# Spreadsheet fixtures are ZIP containers; nothing about them is text.
*.xlsx binary
*.xls binary
